@startuml sequence-forgot-reset-password
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title SIMDP - Sequence: Forgot Password & Reset Password

autonumber

actor "User (Browser)" as Client
participant "AuthController\n(/api/v1/auth/*)" as Ctrl
participant "AuthService" as Svc
participant "SecurityService" as Sec
participant "Email Provider" as Email
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Forgot Password ==
Client -> Ctrl : POST /forgot-password { email }
Ctrl -> Svc : requestPasswordReset({ email, ip })
Svc -> DB : findUser by email

note right of Svc
  Response selalu generik (200 OK)
  agar tidak membocorkan apakah email terdaftar.
end note

alt email ada di DB
    Svc -> Svc : generate raw resetToken (random)
    Svc -> Svc : hash = SHA-256(rawToken)
    Svc -> DB : INSERT PasswordResetToken\n(userId, token=hash, expiresAt=NOW()+1h)
    Svc -> Email : send reset link\n(NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL/reset?token=rawToken)
    Svc -> Sec : log(AUTH_PASSWORD_RESET_REQUESTED)
end

Ctrl --> Client : 200 OK "Jika email terdaftar, link reset telah dikirim"

== Reset Password ==
Client -> Ctrl : POST /reset-password\n{ token: rawToken, newPassword }
Ctrl -> Svc : resetPassword({ rawToken, newPassword, ip })
Svc -> Svc : hash = SHA-256(rawToken)
Svc -> DB : find PasswordResetToken by hash
DB --> Svc : record

alt token not found
    Svc --> Ctrl : 400 Invalid token
    Ctrl --> Client : 400
end

Svc -> Svc : validate: usedAt IS NULL AND expiresAt > NOW()
alt token invalid/expired
    Svc --> Ctrl : 400 Token expired
    Ctrl --> Client : 400
end

Svc -> Svc : validatePassword strength (Zod)
Svc -> Svc : hash newPassword dengan Argon2id
Svc -> DB : UPDATE User.passwordHash
Svc -> DB : UPDATE PasswordResetToken.usedAt = NOW()
Svc -> DB : revoke all RefreshTokens user
Svc -> Sec : log(AUTH_PASSWORD_RESET_SUCCESS)

Ctrl --> Client : 200 OK "Password berhasil direset, silakan login"

@enduml
